%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: MonikaBitterTruth
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568019
    - rid: 268099980525568020
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That... probably was the <i>real</i> {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568021
    - rid: 268099980525568022
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... w-what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Th-that's crazy-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't know what sort of stupid joke you're trying to make-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568023
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But I'm obviously the real {mc}!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I was the one that joined your club, not that other guy-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}...'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Do the Elder Scrolls ever lie?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568024
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: By their nature of being parallel to creation itself, they contain information
      about all possible realities, so-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=1,1>No</NoiseText>...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: There's your proof then, {mc}.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: B-b-but-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '"But if that''s true, then who am I and why am I here?" Right?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568025
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568026
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I know how that feels.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568027
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So before you spiral down an existentialist rabbit hole...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568028
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Let me tell you that you don't need to be the real {mc} to be the real
      you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568029
    - rid: 268099980525568030
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Your lived experiences are still valid; we're still your friends.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Honestly, I don't really remember much of that "real" {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568031
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, I know he was with me in that English class, but he didn't really
      have that much of a presence.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568032
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And despite being Sayori's best friend, I don't really remember him ever
      spending time with her.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Unlike somebody I know~.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568033
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So, uh... yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568034
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm glad <i>you</i> were the one who walked in with Sayori that day.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568035
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Monika?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568036
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you remembered the... original {mc}, why didn't you say anything?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And how did I replace him?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, well, uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568037
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: To be honest, I wasn't really that interested in getting to know you
      at the time.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568038
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I was more focused on... other things.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568039
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And those "other things" were more important than an actual person getting
      replaced?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568040
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '... would you believe me if I said: yes?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568041
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568042
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That still doesn't answer how I replaced him.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568043
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, I don't really know how that happened either.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568044
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure it happened Monday of last week, though.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568045
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Which really isn't that much information, is it? Ahaha...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568046
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568047
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You alright, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's fair.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568049
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So are we gonna let Alduin get away, or...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568050
    - rid: 268099980525568051
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh. Right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568052
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Still have to deal with that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No. No we're not.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I start heading down the mountain.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}? Where are we going?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568053
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Back to Whiterun. I've a ride to catch.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099980525568054
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
